# GitSyncManager Auto-Exclusions
docs/UC-*
docs/traceability_matrix.md
docs/function_rules.md
SKILL.md

# IPC operational artifacts: one-off debug scripts, DOM dump HTML files, and runtime JSON files.
# These are session-level debugging artefacts generated during application runs, not source code.
# Live IPC components (auto_responder.py, smart_auto_responder.py, ipc_watcher.py) ARE committed.
ipc/check_*.py
ipc/write_*.py
ipc/search_dom.py
ipc/generate_response.py
ipc/*.html
ipc/response_*.json
ipc/daemon_heartbeat.json

# IPC sandbox runtime directory (request/response exchange with browser)
ipc_sandbox/

# Campaign output data (scraped jobs, tailored CVs, score files — large, run-specific)
data/

